<section class="section legal-content"><h2>Information we may collect</h2><p>When you contact Sparx Nexora, the website may collect the name, email, phone number, company details and project information you voluntarily submit.</p><h2>How information is used</h2><p>Information may be used to respond to enquiries, prepare estimates, communicate about requested services and improve the website and services.</p><h2>Analytics and cookies</h2><p>If analytics or advertising tools are enabled, they may process technical and usage information according to their own policies. Only enable services you actually use.</p><h2>Data security</h2><p>Use HTTPS, server-side validation, access controls and secure credential management. Never place SMTP passwords, API keys or database credentials in public source code.</p><h2>Third-party services</h2><p>Payment providers, hosting providers, analytics tools, advertising platforms and communication services may process information when they are used for a project.</p><h2>Contact</h2><p>For privacy questions, replace this paragraph with your official privacy contact email and business address.</p></section>
